Z||000008||RossT||05-09-2000||04:29 AM||||Dan, to convert from adobe to jpeg, you have to go to the file menu and go to "export file", that will let you save it under jpeg or just about everything else.||||reg||1
Z||000009||DaRkLoRD||05-09-2000||12:54 PM||||In Photoshop, goto File&gt; Save As.. if you go to the Export menu, it will give you several options, including GIF, but not JPG.||||reg||1
Z||000010||Oreif||05-09-2000||02:20 PM||||To convert any picture to jpg using photoshop, Just open picture, go under EDIT and make sure it is RGB and 8-bit. (if not you can change it) Then go under FILE and select "save a copy as..."<BR>and you will be able to save it as a jpg format.||||reg||1
